{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/587477-beast-anybody-made-a-character-sheet-yet","id":587477,"title":"[Beast] Anybody made a character sheet yet?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-11T16:22:10-07:00","id":587477,"title":"[Beast] Anybody made a character sheet yet?","content":"I don't think there has been any official Beast sheet released yet, does anyone have a custom one they have made that they'd be willing to share?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1985-mindnsoul","name":"mindnsoul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-27T08:21:22-07:00","id":604718,"title":"","content":"Has there been much info about the game put out there? Anyway, I haven't started on one yet. Probably won't until I hear from OP....since I don't know what would be involved(though someone did send me ideas) and I don't have any artwork...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-27T14:27:41-07:00","id":604994,"title":"","content":"You could also made fan early version with general 1ED WoD corebook margins for now. It worked for fan splats before. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-27T20:39:46-07:00","id":605263,"title":"","content":"going to be running a game soon, so I'm whipping up a sheet to use until there's an official one available!<br /> It's not interactive or quite as nice as Mr. Gone's, but hopefully it'll be of some use.<br /> Front side here: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0ur6p-2wTyhWGlaVS1BeDdaZDQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0u...ew?usp=sharing</a><br /> Still working on the back side.<br /> <br /> Edit: It doesn't look quite right on google drive... it looks like downloading it fixes it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-27T23:20:44-07:00","id":605339,"title":"","content":"Where are Legend and Life, Horror, Family and Hunger sections?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T00:48:05-07:00","id":605373,"title":"","content":"Very nice MS, but you forgot Nightmares and Atavisms <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And well, while your Satiety looks good, it doesn't allow to see the numerical rating (I might be wrong here, but I think it's used here and there).<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3648-nepher","name":"Nepher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3648_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T05:04:46-07:00","id":605475,"title":"","content":"Legend and Life are on the top; if you're not seeing them you might need to download it.<br /> <br /> Nightmares and Atavisms are going to be on the back, because I like to have a little more space to write all the details.<br /> <br /> I figured it was more useful to have the Conditions for Satiety rather than the numbers and if you need the number you can count it up like attributes or skills.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-28T05:29:15-07:00","id":605485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MagicSwordsman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/587477-beast-anybody-made-a-character-sheet-yet?p=605475#post605475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nightmares and Atavisms are going to be on the back, because I like to have a little more space to write all the details.</div> </div> </div> </div> Personally, I'd drop Aspirations / EXP to the bottom, and put Atavisms and Nightmares right above it. Use the back for plotting out your Lair and Chambers - that can get really complex, and that's before we start touching on the Traits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T09:18:01-07:00","id":606668,"title":"","content":"Why do you have <i>Kinship</i> as Faction choice? Kinship you put <b>on others</b>, not on your self ( By Family Ties Condition) - each beast can have multiple Ties to it from other supernaturals.<br /> <br /> I would rather put here a <i>Horror</i> section, to remember what Monstrous Soul character have, all the time, as it is, de facto, a Z-Splat of character. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T11:04:29-07:00","id":606841,"title":"","content":"One of the main ways my group has been defining our characters with is what other supernatural groups they're close with. It's not exactly equivalent to the z-splat, but it's easy enough to say &quot;Vampires&quot; or &quot;Mages and Werewolves&quot; or just &quot;N/A.&quot; It's not <i>just</i> &quot;who do you have Family Ties on&quot; because that can easily change during play, it's more linked to your character at conception.<br /> <br /> Normally I'd put the Horror description on the Concept line, but having it separate seems fine. Horror isn't really any more of a z-splat than kinship, though...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2021-magicswordsman","name":"MagicSwordsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}